# Build output. `make` writes to ra4m2/Debug (or ra4m2/Release with BUILD=Release);
# both hold the .elf, .srec, the code-flash-only .bin, the .map, and every .o/.d.
Debug/
Release/

# Generated by the Makefile from .secure_rzone at build time, into $(BUILD).
# Listed here as well because e2 studio's RA content generation drops its own copy
# into ra4m2/script/, where -Lscript would silently win over the generated one -
# see the -L note in ra4m2/Makefile. Never commit either copy.
memory_regions.ld

# JLinkExe drops this wherever it is invoked; `make flash` runs from ra4m2/.
JLinkLog.log

# macOS
.DS_Store
